  "remarks": "Afipsky Oil Refinery is one of the largest refineries in southern Russia with an annual processing capacity of 6,25  million tons. It produces gasoline, diesel and aviation fuel. The energy sector, especially the oil and gas sectors, provide a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, Afipsky Oil Refinery is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
